		{
			can_repeat: false
			description: [
				"恶魔扭蛋机是屠夫扭蛋机的镜像：同样是四个等级，但内容池完全不同，没有配方也没有世界生成。其内容物在此处填充。"
				"TWO THINGS ARE NOT HERE, ON PURPOSE. &#e8e2d4&lBlood of Muzan&r and the nine &#c0392b&lBlood Demon Arts&r. Both are granted elsewhere - the arts in their own act, &#c0392b&lMuzan&r’s blood as an in-world drop only - and putting either on sale would hand the two most &#6fd3e0&lImportant&r items on the demon path a shop."
				"此处的物品：血肉、恶魔的服饰与礼器、用于施展&#c0392b&lBlood Demon Arts&r的武器，以及维持恶魔活性所需的炼金材料。"
				"和 Slayer Depot 一样，每次交易都会重复，而且日元会被真正消耗掉。"
			]
